{
  "info": {
    "name": "RockDrop API",
    "description": "API completa para el juego multijugador Piedra Papel Tijera.\n\n**Variables requeridas (configurar antes de ejecutar):**\n- `base_url` — https://{api-id}.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev\n- `ws_url`   — wss://{ws-api-id}.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev\n- `host_player_id` — UUID fijo del host (genera uno y reutilízalo)\n- `host_token` — API Key del host\n\n**Variables auto-capturadas por los scripts de test:**\n- `session_id`, `qr_token`, `guest_player_id`, `guest_player_id_2`, `guest_player_id_3`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "rockdrop-api-v2"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",         "value": "https://REPLACE.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ws_url",           "value": "wss://REPLACE.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev",  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "host_player_id",   "value": "host-uuid-replace-me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "host_token",       "value": "REPLACE_WITH_HOST_TOKEN", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "session_id",       "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "qr_token",         "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "guest_player_id",  "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "guest_player_id_2","value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "guest_player_id_3","value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "1 — Sessions",
      "description": "Ciclo de vida de una sesión. El Host crea y cierra; cualquiera puede consultar.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Create Session",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "pm.test('Has session_id', () => pm.expect(res.data.session_id).to.be.a('string'));",
            "pm.test('Has qr_token',   () => pm.expect(res.data.qr_token).to.include('.'));",
            "pm.test('Has ws_url',     () => pm.expect(res.data.ws_url).to.include('wss://'));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', res.data.session_id);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('qr_token',   res.data.qr_token);",
            "console.log('session_id:', res.data.session_id);",
            "console.log('join_url:',   res.data.join_url);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-host-token", "value": "{{host_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"host_player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\",\n  \"display_name\": \"Host\",\n  \"mode\": \"FREE_FOR_ALL\",\n  \"max_players\": 30\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions"] },
            "description": "Host crea una sesión. Guarda automáticamente `session_id` y `qr_token`.\n\n**Modos:** `FREE_FOR_ALL` | `TOURNAMENT`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 — Session Created",
              "status": "Created", "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"session_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"qr_token\": \"eyJhbGci...\",\n    \"join_url\": \"https://rockdrop.app/join?token=eyJhbGci...\",\n    \"ws_url\": \"wss://ws-id.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev\",\n    \"mode\": \"FREE_FOR_ALL\",\n    \"max_players\": 30,\n    \"status\": \"WAITING\"\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Get Session",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Status válido', () => pm.expect(res.data.status).to.be.oneOf(['WAITING','PLAYING','FINISHED']));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}"] },
            "description": "Consulta el estado de la sesión. Disponible para Host y Guests."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Session State",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"session_id\": \"a1b2c3d4\",\n    \"status\": \"WAITING\",\n    \"mode\": \"FREE_FOR_ALL\",\n    \"current_round\": 0,\n    \"player_count\": 2,\n    \"max_players\": 30,\n    \"host_player_id\": \"host-uuid\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-06-01T18:00:00Z\"\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 — Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found", "code": 404,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Session not found or expired\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "03 Close Session",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Status FINISHED', () => pm.expect(res.data.status).to.equal('FINISHED'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "x-host-token", "value": "{{host_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}"] },
            "description": "Solo el Host puede cerrar la sesión. Hace broadcast WS `GAME_FINISHED` a todos los jugadores conectados."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Session Closed",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"session_id\": \"a1b2c3d4\",\n    \"status\": \"FINISHED\",\n    \"final_scores\": [\n      { \"player_id\": \"host-uuid\", \"display_name\": \"Host\", \"score\": 3 },\n      { \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid\", \"display_name\": \"Guest\", \"score\": 1 }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "2 — Players",
      "description": "Guests se unen con el QR token; cualquiera puede listar jugadores.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "04 Join Session (Guest)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has player_id', () => pm.expect(res.data.player_id).to.be.a('string'));",
            "pm.test('Has ws_url',    () => pm.expect(res.data.ws_url).to.include('wss://'));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('guest_player_id', res.data.player_id);",
            "console.log('guest_player_id:', res.data.player_id);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\",\n  \"token\": \"{{qr_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/players", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","players"] },
            "description": "Guest se une usando el JWT del QR. Expira 1 hora desde la creación.\n\nGuarda `guest_player_id` automáticamente."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 — Joined",
              "status": "Created", "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid-xyz\",\n    \"session_id\": \"a1b2c3d4\",\n    \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\",\n    \"ws_url\": \"wss://ws-id.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev?session_id=a1b2c3d4&player_id=guest-uuid-xyz\"\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 — Token inválido",
              "status": "Unauthorized", "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Token invalid or expired\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 — Sesión llena",
              "status": "Conflict", "code": 409,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Session is full (max_players reached)\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "05 Get Players",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('players es array', () => pm.expect(res.data.players).to.be.an('array'));",
            "console.log('Jugadores conectados:', res.data.players.length);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/players", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","players"] },
            "description": "Lista todos los jugadores con su status de conexión y score acumulado."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Players List",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"players\": [\n      { \"player_id\": \"host-uuid\",  \"display_name\": \"Host\",    \"is_host\": true,  \"status\": \"CONNECTED\", \"score\": 2 },\n      { \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\", \"is_host\": false, \"status\": \"CONNECTED\", \"score\": 1 }\n    ],\n    \"total\": 2\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "3 — Game",
      "description": "Envío de movimientos y consulta de resultados. `resolve_round` se dispara automáticamente via EventBridge cuando todos los jugadores envían su movimiento.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "06 Submit Move — Guest (ROCK)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Movimiento aceptado', () => pm.expect(res.data.accepted).to.be.true);",
            "console.log('Esperando', res.data.waiting_for, 'jugadores más');"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"player_id\": \"{{guest_player_id}}\",\n  \"move\": \"ROCK\",\n  \"round_number\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/move", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","move"] },
            "description": "Jugador envía su movimiento para la ronda actual.\n\n`move`: `ROCK` | `PAPER` | `SCISSORS`\n\nCuando todos los jugadores envían, EventBridge dispara `resolve_round` y se hace broadcast `ROUND_RESOLVED` por WebSocket."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Movimiento aceptado (esperando)",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": { \"accepted\": true, \"round_number\": 1, \"waiting_for\": 1, \"message\": \"Waiting for 1 more player.\" },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 — Último movimiento (dispara resolución)",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": { \"accepted\": true, \"round_number\": 1, \"waiting_for\": 0, \"message\": \"All players submitted. Resolving round...\" },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 — Movimiento inválido",
              "status": "Bad Request", "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Invalid move. Must be ROCK, PAPER, or SCISSORS\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 — Movimiento duplicado",
              "status": "Conflict", "code": 409,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Player already submitted a move for this round\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "07 Submit Move — Host (SCISSORS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\",\n  \"move\": \"SCISSORS\",\n  \"round_number\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/move", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","move"] },
            "description": "Host envía SCISSORS (pierde contra ROCK del guest). Al ser el último movimiento, dispara la resolución."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "07b Submit Move — Host (ROCK)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\",\n  \"move\": \"ROCK\",\n  \"round_number\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/move", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","move"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "07c Submit Move — Host (PAPER)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\",\n  \"move\": \"PAPER\",\n  \"round_number\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/move", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","move"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "08 Get Round Result",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Tiene resultados', () => pm.expect(res.data.results).to.be.an('object'));",
            "const winner = res.data.winner_id ? res.data.winner_id : 'EMPATE';",
            "console.log('Ganador ronda 1:', winner);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/round/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","round","1"] },
            "description": "Resultado de la ronda 1. Cambia el número al final de la URL para consultar otras rondas."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Resultado con ganador",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"round_number\": 1,\n    \"winner_id\": \"guest-uuid\",\n    \"is_tie\": false,\n    \"results\": {\n      \"guest-uuid\": { \"move\": \"ROCK\",     \"outcome\": \"WIN\",  \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\" },\n      \"host-uuid\":  { \"move\": \"SCISSORS\", \"outcome\": \"LOSE\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" }\n    },\n    \"resolved_at\": \"2026-06-01T18:05:32Z\"\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 — Empate",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"round_number\": 1,\n    \"winner_id\": null,\n    \"is_tie\": true,\n    \"results\": {\n      \"guest-uuid\": { \"move\": \"ROCK\", \"outcome\": \"TIE\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\" },\n      \"host-uuid\":  { \"move\": \"ROCK\", \"outcome\": \"TIE\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" }\n    },\n    \"resolved_at\": \"2026-06-01T18:06:10Z\"\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 — Ronda aún no resuelta",
              "status": "Not Found", "code": 404,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": \"Round not yet resolved\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "4 — Tournament",
      "description": "Modo torneo con bracket eliminatorio 1v1. Solo disponible en sesiones creadas con `mode: TOURNAMENT`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "09 Generate Bracket",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Tiene matches', () => pm.expect(res.data.matches).to.be.an('array'));",
            "console.log('Matches generados:', res.data.matches.length);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-host-token", "value": "{{host_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"host_player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/tournament/bracket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","tournament","bracket"] },
            "description": "Solo Host. Genera el bracket con los jugadores actuales.\n\n- Shuffle aleatorio\n- Si el número no es potencia de 2, asigna byes automáticos\n- Broadcast WS `BRACKET_UPDATED`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 — Bracket (4 jugadores)",
              "status": "Created", "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"bracket_id\": \"bracket-uuid\",\n    \"total_rounds\": 2,\n    \"current_round\": 1,\n    \"matches\": [\n      { \"match_id\": \"m1\", \"round\": 1, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" },    \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid2\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\" }, \"status\": \"PENDING\" },\n      { \"match_id\": \"m2\", \"round\": 1, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid3\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 2\" }, \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid4\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 3\" }, \"status\": \"PENDING\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "201 — Bracket con bye (3 jugadores)",
              "status": "Created", "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"bracket_id\": \"bracket-uuid\",\n    \"total_rounds\": 2,\n    \"current_round\": 1,\n    \"matches\": [\n      { \"match_id\": \"m1\", \"round\": 1, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" },    \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid2\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\" }, \"status\": \"PENDING\" },\n      { \"match_id\": \"m2\", \"round\": 1, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid3\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 2\" }, \"player_b\": null, \"is_bye\": true, \"status\": \"AUTO_WIN\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "10 Get Bracket",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Tiene matches', () => pm.expect(res.data.matches).to.be.an('array'));",
            "if (res.data.champion) console.log('Campeon:', res.data.champion.display_name);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/tournament/bracket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","tournament","bracket"] },
            "description": "Estado completo del bracket. Incluye matches completados, pendientes y campeón si aplica."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Bracket en curso",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"bracket_id\": \"bracket-uuid\",\n    \"total_rounds\": 2,\n    \"current_round\": 2,\n    \"champion\": null,\n    \"matches\": [\n      { \"match_id\": \"m1\", \"round\": 1, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\" }, \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid2\" }, \"winner_id\": \"uuid1\", \"status\": \"COMPLETED\" },\n      { \"match_id\": \"m3\", \"round\": 2, \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\" }, \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid3\" }, \"winner_id\": null,   \"status\": \"PENDING\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 — Campeón declarado",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"bracket_id\": \"bracket-uuid\",\n    \"total_rounds\": 2,\n    \"current_round\": 3,\n    \"champion\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" },\n    \"matches\": []\n  },\n  \"error\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "11 Advance Bracket",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const res = pm.response.json();",
            "if (res.data.champion) {",
            "  pm.test('Tiene campeón', () => pm.expect(res.data.champion.player_id).to.be.a('string'));",
            "  console.log('Campeon:', res.data.champion.display_name);",
            "} else {",
            "  console.log('Avanzó a ronda:', res.data.current_round);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-host-token", "value": "{{host_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"host_player_id\": \"{{host_player_id}}\",\n  \"completed_round\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/tournament/bracket/advance", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","tournament","bracket","advance"] },
            "description": "Solo Host. Avanza a la siguiente ronda cuando todos los matches de la ronda actual están completados.\n\nSi queda 1 jugador, declara campeón."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Avanzó a siguiente ronda",
              "status": "OK", "code": 200,
