    {
      "name": "5 — WebSocket Referencia",
      "description": "Documentación del protocolo WebSocket. Estos ítems no son llamadas HTTP — son referencias del contrato de eventos.\n\n**Conexión:**\n```\nwss://{ws-id}.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev?session_id={id}&player_id={id}\n```\n\n**Eventos Server → Client:**\n| Evento | Cuándo se emite |\n|---|---|\n| `PLAYER_JOINED` | Un guest se une |\n| `PLAYER_DISCONNECTED` | Un jugador pierde la conexión |\n| `ROUND_STARTED` | El host inicia una nueva ronda |\n| `MOVE_SUBMITTED` | Un jugador envía movimiento (sin revelar cuál) |\n| `ROUND_RESOLVED` | Todos enviaron — muestra resultados |\n| `BRACKET_UPDATED` | Se genera o avanza el bracket |\n| `GAME_FINISHED` | El host cierra la sesión |",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[WS] PLAYER_JOINED",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/players", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","players"] },
            "description": "**Evento emitido a todos los clientes cuando un guest hace join.**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"PLAYER_JOINED\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid\",\n    \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\",\n    \"total_players\": 3\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] ROUND_RESOLVED",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/game/round/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","game","round","1"] },
            "description": "**Evento emitido cuando todos los jugadores enviaron su movimiento.**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"ROUND_RESOLVED\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"round_number\": 1,\n    \"winner_id\": \"guest-uuid\",\n    \"is_tie\": false,\n    \"results\": {\n      \"guest-uuid\": { \"move\": \"ROCK\",     \"outcome\": \"WIN\",  \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\" },\n      \"host-uuid\":  { \"move\": \"SCISSORS\", \"outcome\": \"LOSE\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" }\n    },\n    \"leaderboard\": [\n      { \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\", \"score\": 1 },\n      { \"player_id\": \"host-uuid\",  \"display_name\": \"Host\",    \"score\": 0 }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] BRACKET_UPDATED",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}/tournament/bracket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}","tournament","bracket"] },
            "description": "**Evento emitido cuando se genera o avanza el bracket de torneo.**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"BRACKET_UPDATED\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"current_round\": 2,\n    \"champion\": null,\n    \"new_matches\": [\n      {\n        \"match_id\": \"m3\",\n        \"round\": 2,\n        \"player_a\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid1\", \"display_name\": \"Host\" },\n        \"player_b\": { \"player_id\": \"uuid3\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 2\" }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[WS] GAME_FINISHED",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/sessions/{{session_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["sessions","{{session_id}}"] },
            "description": "**Evento emitido a todos cuando el host cierra la sesión.**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"GAME_FINISHED\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"final_scores\": [\n      { \"player_id\": \"guest-uuid\", \"display_name\": \"Guest 1\", \"score\": 3 },\n      { \"player_id\": \"host-uuid\",  \"display_name\": \"Host\",    \"score\": 1 }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

